@startuml overview
' cumin-works - how an Assignee decides together with the Claude Code of a Maintainer.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

|Claude Code of a Maintainer|
start
if () then (start of work, or asked)
  :list the issues that wait for\na decision of the Assignee, as trees;
else (watching)
  :read GitHub at an interval\nuntil a new issue waits for a decision;
  :prepare the report;
endif
:report: what to decide, what was checked,\nconcerns, recommendation, choices;
|Assignee|
:decide, and say so\nfor one issue or pull request;
|Claude Code of a Maintainer|
:write the decision to GitHub;
stop

@enduml
